WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
<v Alice>සැමට සුභ උදෑසනක්. අපි සතිපතා රැස්වීම ආරම්භ කරමු.</v>

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.000
<v Dumindu>ආයුබෝවන්, අද රැස්වීමේ කාර්ය සූචිය බලමු.</v>

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Dumindu>මම හොඳින්, ස්තුතියි.</v>

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.744
<v Alice>The quarterly numbers look good,</v>

5
00:00:10.824 --> 00:00:13.126
<v Alice>but we need to improve the Sinhala
transcription accuracy,</v>

6
00:00:13.206 --> 00:00:14.206
<v Alice>especially for names.</v>

7
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.000
<v Dumindu>Agreed. I'll review the rules with Zoom &amp;
Teams &lt;beta&gt; next week.</v>

8
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
<v Alice>After a long pause: a quote "hello", and a
comma.</v>

